<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home-redesign.css" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><style>.legal-page{max-width:850px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 20px}.legal-page h1{margin-bottom:30px}.legal-page h2{margin-top:35px}.legal-page p,.legal-page li{color:#59615a;line-height:1.8}</style></head><body class="home-redesign"><%- include('partials/header_new') %><main class="legal-page"><p class="text-uppercase text-muted">FushidaLanka Hardware</p><h1><%= pageTitle %></h1><% if (kind === 'privacy') { %><p>FushidaLanka Hardware respects your privacy. We collect only the information you provide when requesting a quote, contacting our team, or using account features.</p><h2>Information we use</h2><p>Contact details and enquiry information are used to respond to your request, arrange delivery, provide support, and improve our service. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:aman@fushidalanka.com">aman@fushidalanka.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+94757505820">+94 75 750 5820</a>.</p><% } else { %><p>By using the FushidaLanka website, you agree to use it lawfully and provide accurate information when submitting an enquiry or requesting a quote.</p><h2>Products and quotes</h2><p>Product availability, prices, delivery times and warranties may vary. A quote or product enquiry is subject to confirmation by our team.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be directed to <a href="mailto:aman@fushidalanka.com">aman@fushidalanka.com</a>.</p><% } %></main><%- include('partials/footer') %><script src="/js/main.js"></script></body></html>
